# Vercel Documentation

- For deployments, projects, environments, domains, observability, functions, and platform configuration, use the official documentation as the primary reference: https://vercel.com/docs
- Prefer Vercel documentation and connected Vercel tools over assumptions about current platform behavior.
- Inspect the relevant project and deployment state before recommending configuration changes.
- Do not deploy, modify production settings, domains, or environment variables without explicit user authorization.
